 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Firewall Management Service API (2018-01-01). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Applications lists, protocols lists and resource sets are configuration metadata that need no Firewall Manager administrator account or AWS Organizations: no policy, AWS WAF rule, security group, network firewall or DNS firewall is created or applied to any account. PutAppsList, PutProtocolsList and PutResourceSet only create new resources: ListId, Id, update tokens, previous list versions and ResourceSetStatus are refused, so delete and recreate a list or resource set to change it. Managed default lists are not served: ListAppsLists and ListProtocolsLists with DefaultLists true return no lists, and GetAppsList or GetProtocolsList with DefaultList true reports ResourceNotFoundException. Policies, compliance, violations, protection status, notification channels, administrator accounts and scopes, resource set associations, discovered resources and third-party firewalls return UnknownOperationException with HTTP 501.",
  "title": "AWS Firewall Manager (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2018-01-01"
 },
